@startuml
actor User
participant GeoDiary
participant "Google OAuth" as Google
participant "User model" as UserModel
database "MongoDB/session store" as DB
User -> GeoDiary : GET /auth/google
GeoDiary -> Google : authorize
Google --> GeoDiary : callback + profile
GeoDiary -> UserModel : lookup/upsert googleId
UserModel -> DB : findOneAndUpdate
DB --> UserModel : user
GeoDiary -> DB : session with user ID
GeoDiary --> User : redirect /diaries
@enduml
